 "ThePatternEverywhere": {
  "caption": "S21: failure, empty, pending and loading drawn one way in every place.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__frame kanso-story--wide\"><div class=\"kanso-story--board\">\n    <div class=\"kanso-story__scroll\">\n<p class=\"kanso-story__caption\" style=\"font-weight:600;margin:var(--k-sp-1) 0 var(--k-sp-3)\">Failure block</p><div class=\"kanso-story__layout-row\" style=\"gap:var(--k-sp-4);flex-wrap:wrap;width:1176px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:var(--k-sp-4)\"><div><p class=\"kanso-story__caption\">Sidebar: a word on the row, as Off</p><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-sidebar--slice\" style=\"width:256px\"><div class=\"kanso-sidebar__row kanso-row--machine\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-row__leading-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-server\"/></svg><span class=\"kanso-row__name\">dark</span><span class=\"kanso-row__directory\">Unreachable</span><span class=\"kanso-button--disclosure\" title=\"Refresh\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon \"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div></div></div><div><p class=\"kanso-story__caption\">Right-click: the source's words, the fixes and the agent</p><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-sidebar--slice\" style=\"width:256px;position:relative;height:300px\"><div class=\"kanso-sidebar__row kanso-row--machine\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-row__leading-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-server\"/></svg><span class=\"kanso-row__name\">dark</span><span class=\"kanso-row__directory\">Unreachable</span><span class=\"kanso-button--disclosure\" title=\"Refresh\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon \"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"kanso-menu\" style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;top:40px\"><div class=\"kanso-menu__heading\">ssh: connect to host dark port 22: Operation timed out</div><div class=\"kanso-menu-item\">Refresh</div><div class=\"kanso-menu-item\">Sign in…</div><div class=\"kanso-menu-item\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--narrow\"><use href=\"#lu-bot\"/></svg>Explain to Kylo-ren</div><div class=\"kanso-menu__separator\"></div><div class=\"kanso-menu-item\">Only